		"Id": "mechdef_wasp_WSP-3MC",
		"Name": "Wasp",
		"Details": "With the Trinity Alliance's development of the Heavy and Light Plasma Rifles, the allied governments of the Alliance began distributing them to their military-industrial complexes. The Magistracy of Canopus ended up with the lion's share of the Light Plasma Rifles and put them on a series of refit designs meant to showcase the new weapon's potental. Among those designs was the Wasp WSP-3MC. The WSP-3MC is a very simple refit of the earlier WSP-3M which drops all of that design's weaponry in exchange for a single Light Plasma Rifle and a ton of ammunition. While nothing to write home about, the -3MC was well regarded as a nuisance on the battlefield and proved popular with Canopian light 'Mech pilots.",
		"Icon": "uixTxrIcon_wasp"
	},
